    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπτύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spit upon</i> or <i>at</i>, esp. as a mark of abhorrence
			or contempt, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς οὐχὶ κατέπτυσεν
				ἂν σοῦ</span>; <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.200
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. δωροδοκίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλούτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Icar.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1179
			</span></i>. [On the quantity, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύω</span>
			.]</div>
